

This is a deliberately non-valid safetensors fixture for model-due-diligence tests.

It is kept as plain text so the repository does not include real model weights,
large binary artefacts or third-party model payloads.

The file name is intentionally model-like so tests can exercise safetensors
extension handling, inventory classification, hashing, report generation and
malformed-header detection.

This file is not a valid safetensors model.
It must not be loaded by any model runtime.
It contains no tensor data, executable code, credentials or binary payloads.